---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="What data Light collects and how it is used.">
  <article class="prose prose-neutral">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>
      This page explains what data this website collects, why, and what you can do about it. The
      site is a static website, so it does not have user accounts and does not ask you to log in.
    </p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Aggregate analytics about which pages are visited and how visitors arrive.</li>
      <li>Advertising identifiers set by advertising partners when you consent to cookies.</li>
      <li>Any information you choose to send us by email.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
    <p>
      Third-party advertising partners may set cookies to show relevant ads. You can accept or
      decline these cookies through the consent banner, and you can change your choice at any time
      in your browser settings. Read the <a href="/cookie-policy/">Cookie Policy</a> for details.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      Depending on where you live, you may have the right to access, correct, or delete your data, or
      to object to certain processing. To make a request, use the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this policy when our practices change. The latest version is always on this page.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
